00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.260
Woll made the save.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.160
Rebound snapped up.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:18.200
Brodine will hurry
one that's blocked.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:20.097
Johansson charges way,
got past the check.

00:20:20.097 --> 00:20:21.180
