week in Stockholm.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.940
Holy Mackinaw, Willie!

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:41.870
Have a trip to Sweden.

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:43.820
The Leafs win it in overtime.

00:20:48.460 --> 00:20:49.270
Hey, guys.

00:20:49.270 --> 00:20:50.310
Way to go, everyone.

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:52.060
It's fair to say it's
a pretty fitting end

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.770
